{
  "nodes": [
    {"id": "document:packages/credentials/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/credentials/README.md", "summary": "credentials 包组总览：配置只引用凭据名不内嵌值——credentials 负责 secrets 的存取删、credentials-local 是默认本机存储（私有 YAML 文件优先于环境回退）、authorization 用于需要人工参与的凭据获取；轮换后的存储值下一个请求即生效。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-group", "credentials", "authorization", "overview"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "document:packages/credentials/authorization/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/credentials/authorization/README.md", "summary": "dsh-authorization 包参考文档：插件注册凭据获取流程（ctx.authorization seam），人工引导的登录/输码/问答只在发起它的 surface 上提示；凭据真正写入存储后才报 authorized，拒绝/撤回报 cancelled。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-reference", "authorization", "human-in-loop", "flows"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/authorization/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/authorization/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-authorization 包清单：authorization seam（ctx.authorization）定义，peer 依赖 dsh-credentials、dsh-llm 与 cordis。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "dependencies"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/authorization/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/authorization/tsconfig.json", "summary": "authorization 的 TypeScript 项目引用配置：引用 vendor/cosmokit、vendor/cordis、credentials 与 llm/llm。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "project-references"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "document:packages/credentials/credentials/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/credentials/credentials/README.md", "summary": "dsh-credentials 包参考文档：抽象凭据 seam（ctx.credentials），settings 与 cordis.yml 以键名引用 secrets；另存每插件持久凭据记录（授权 grant、provider 环境值），配置 UI 可报告键是否已设/来源/可写性但永不暴露值。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-reference", "credentials", "secrets", "service-definition"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/credentials/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/credentials/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials 包清单：抽象凭据 seam 包，仅 peer 依赖 cordis（零第三方运行时依赖）。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "dependencies", "leaf-package"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/credentials/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/credentials/tsconfig.json", "summary": "credentials 的 TypeScript 项目引用配置：引用 vendor/cosmokit、vendor/cordis 与 util/brand。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "project-references"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "document:packages/credentials/credentials-local/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/credentials/credentials-local/README.md", "summary": "dsh-credentials-local 包参考文档：本机文件型凭据 provider（$DSH_HOME/.env，仅同 OS 用户可读、自动重载）；查找优先级为存储文件 > 启动环境 > 项目 .env > harness-home .env，并明示无法对 agent 工具进程隔离 secrets。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-reference", "credentials", "file-storage", "precedence"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/credentials-local/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/credentials-local/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials-local 包清单：文件型凭据 provider，peer 依赖 dsh-atomic-write、dsh-credentials、dsh-launch-environment、dsh-home-paths 与 cordis。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "dependencies"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/credentials-local/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/credentials-local/tsconfig.json", "summary": "credentials-local 的 TypeScript 项目引用配置：引用 vendor 三件、util/atomic-write、util/launch-environment、util/home-paths 与 credentials。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "project-references"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "document:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/README.md", "summary": "dsh-deepseek-account 包参考文档：账户消费者读取存储登录态、启动/取消浏览器登录与登出而无需编辑 API key；getPlatformSession 提供 Host-only origin/token 快照供原生 Platform 嵌入，模型消费者只为 provider 配置的推理 origin 解析账户凭据。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-reference", "account", "service-definition", "browser-login"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-deepseek-account 包清单：读取账户状态并解析官方 API 凭据，peer 依赖 cordis、dsh-brand、dsh-agent、dsh-llm、dsh-util-values。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "dependencies"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/tsconfig.json", "summary": "deepseek-account 的 TypeScript 项目引用配置：引用 vendor/cosmokit、vendor/cordis、util/brand、core/agent 与 llm/llm。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "project-references"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "document:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/README.md", "summary": "dsh-deepseek-account-platform 包参考文档：经系统浏览器 PKCE 登录并把账户凭据存入既有本地凭据库；本地取消阻止迟到的回调与交换响应完成登录，平台请求错误码语义（no-response/expired 等）与设备身份读取契约在此定义。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-reference", "pkce", "oauth", "service-provider"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-deepseek-account-platform 包清单：浏览器 PKCE 账户授权 provider，peer 依赖 cordis、dsh-deepseek-account、dsh-authorization、dsh-credentials、dsh-host-webserver，运行时依赖 schemastery 与 zod。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest", "dependencies"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "config:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/tsconfig.json", "summary": "deepseek-account-platform 的 TypeScript 项目引用配置：引用 vendor/cosmokit、vendor/cordis、vendor/schemastery、deepseek-account、authorization、credentials 与 host/webserver。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript", "project-references"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "file:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/types.ts", "type": "file", "name": "types.ts", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/types.ts", "summary": "账户包 client-safe 公共类型：AccountClientMetadata/AccountView/SignInAttemptView 等视图类型（凭据永不跨此投影）、Branded 的 SignInAttemptId/AccountUserId，以及经 declare module 向 cordis Events 注册的 session-expired 与 model-sign-in-required 两个通知事件。", "tags": ["type-definition", "account", "client-safe", "branded-ids", "event-map"], "complexity": "simple", "languageNotes": "Branded<'SignInAttemptId'> 等不透明 id 类型来自 dsh-brand；对 @deepseek-ai/cordis 的 Events 接口做 declaration merging 注册 @mode emit 事件。"},
    {"id": "file:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "type": "file", "name": "index.ts", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "summary": "Account Service Definition：抽象类 DeepSeekAccount（ctx key deepseekAccount）声明 getState/getProfile/getBalance/签到/登出/watch/resolveToken/getPlatformSession 等 14 个抽象操作，PlatformSession Host-only 接口与 mergePlatformCookies/platformClientHeaders/platformWireLocale 等头部构造工具随包导出。", "tags": ["service-definition", "account", "abstract-service", "entry-point", "cordis"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "abstract class extends Service 且以 declare module 向 cordis Context 注册 deepseekAccount 服务键；典型 capability seam 的 Service Definition 角色。"},
    {"id": "class:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts:DeepSeekAccount", "type": "class", "name": "DeepSeekAccount", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [32, 118], "summary": "账户能力 Service Definition（abstract class extends Service，ctx key deepseekAccount）：14 个抽象方法覆盖账户状态/资料/余额/奖励通知查询、浏览器登录启动取消、登出、watch 订阅、推理 origin 限定的 token 解析与 Host-only PlatformSession 读取。", "tags": ["service-definition", "abstract-class", "account", "cordis-service", "capability-seam"], "complexity": "complex"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts:mergePlatformCookies", "type": "function", "name": "mergePlatformCookies", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [127, 137], "summary": "按大小写敏感的 Cookie 名合并两组 Cookie 头，deployment cookies 值优先且保留无关条目，每个名字至多一对。", "tags": ["utility", "http-headers", "cookies", "merge"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts:desktopClientHeaders", "type": "function", "name": "desktopClientHeaders", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [144, 147], "summary": "为原生桌面 API 请求生成 x-client-platform 头（win32→desktop-win、darwin→desktop-mac），非桌面返回空对象。", "tags": ["utility", "http-headers", "desktop", "identity"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts:platformClientHeaders", "type": "function", "name": "platformClientHeaders", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [155, 164], "summary": "由桌面平台与 AccountClientMetadata 构造五个 Platform 客户端身份头（bundle-id 故意为空、locale 经 platformWireLocale 归一、timezone 偏移秒）。", "tags": ["utility", "http-headers", "client-identity"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts:platformWireLocale", "type": "function", "name": "platformWireLocale", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/index.ts", "lineRange": [172, 174], "summary": "把 UI 语言（zh-CN/zh_TW/en-US 等）归一为 Platform 线上 locale：主子标签为 zh 即 zh_CN，否则 en_US；请求头与请求体共用此归一。", "tags": ["utility", "locale", "normalization"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "file:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/account-tasks.ts", "type": "file", "name": "account-tasks.ts", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/account-tasks.ts", "summary": "账户登出对运行中任务的处理策略：isRunningAccountTask 判定 Agent 最新绑定请求是否走 deepseek-account 路由；installAccountTaskCancellation 在 ACCOUNT_SIGN_IN_REQUIRED 错误时广播登录引导、在登出事件时取消所有运行中的账户任务（保留 inbox）。", "tags": ["utility", "task-cancellation", "agent-lifecycle", "account"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/account-tasks.ts:isRunningAccountTask", "type": "function", "name": "isRunningAccountTask", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/account-tasks.ts", "lineRange": [111, 113], "summary": "判定一个运行中 Agent 的最新绑定请求是否使用 deepseek-account provider 路由，即登出是否应中断该任务。", "tags": ["utility", "predicate", "request-context"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/account-tasks.ts:installAccountTaskCancellation", "type": "function", "name": "installAccountTaskCancellation", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account/src/account-tasks.ts", "lineRange": [119, 134], "summary": "在账户 provider 生命周期上安装两条监听：agent/error 遇 LlmError ACCOUNT_SIGN_IN_REQUIRED 广播 model-sign-in-required；signed-out 事件取消所有运行中的账户任务（hook 原因、keepInbox）。", "tags": ["event-handler", "cancellation", "cordis-inject", "account"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "file:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "type": "file", "name": "protocol.ts", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "summary": "Platform HTTP 协议层：origin/浏览器 URL/请求头/login 回调 origin 的严格校验，envelope+biz_code 响应读取（64KB 体积上限、401/40003 判定过期、非敏感诊断走 stderr），以及 auth_init/auth_exchange、账户详情、bonus、logout 各端点请求函数与 PlatformAuthError 错误体系。", "tags": ["protocol", "http-client", "validation", "oauth", "error-handling"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "platformRequest 手工流式读取响应体并设 65536 字节上限，zod 校验 envelope {code:0,data:{biz_code,biz_data}}；拒绝重定向、凭据永不入日志。"},
    {"id": "class:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:PlatformAuthError", "type": "class", "name": "PlatformAuthError", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [6, 9], "summary": "携带稳定 SignInErrorCode 分类码的协议错误；消息只含 code，永不携带响应体或授权 URL。", "tags": ["error-class", "protocol", "account"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "class:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:AccountUnauthorizedError", "type": "class", "name": "AccountUnauthorizedError", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [12, 14], "summary": "Platform 以 HTTP 401 或响应码 40003 拒绝已认证请求时抛出（code 固定 expired），触发凭据过期处理。", "tags": ["error-class", "unauthorized", "protocol"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:platformOrigin", "type": "function", "name": "platformOrigin", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [22, 30], "summary": "只接受 HTTPS Platform origin，或显式开启的 loopback 开发 HTTP；拒绝携带凭据/路径/查询/片段的 URL 并归一为 origin。", "tags": ["validation", "url", "security"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:browserUrl", "type": "function", "name": "browserUrl", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [40, 55], "summary": "校验 Platform 返回的浏览器目的地 URL 必须落在配置 origin 与固定 path 上（可按需改写 origin 供私有开发代理），拒绝凭据/片段，失败抛 protocol 错并输出非敏感诊断。", "tags": ["validation", "url", "open-redirect", "security"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:platformHeaders", "type": "function", "name": "platformHeaders", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [62, 74], "summary": "校验 Host-only 部署请求头：authorization/x-dsh-auth-token/host/content-length 等保留头与重复头一律拒绝，值不在诊断中暴露。", "tags": ["validation", "http-headers", "security"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:requestPlatform", "type": "function", "name": "requestPlatform", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [93, 98], "summary": "向 /auth-api/v0/dsh/<method> 发 JSON POST，body 永不记日志，返回经调用方 schema 校验的业务载荷。", "tags": ["http-client", "platform-api", "post"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:requestAccount", "type": "function", "name": "requestAccount", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [109, 113], "summary": "以 x-dsh-auth-token 头携带 grant GET 固定账户端点（users/current 或 get_user_summary），grant 保留在 Host 请求头。", "tags": ["http-client", "account-api", "get"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:requestUnnotifiedBonuses", "type": "function", "name": "requestUnnotifiedBonuses", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [123, 127], "summary": "GET 未记录已展示的 bonus 列表端点，返回业务载荷由调用方 zod 数组校验。", "tags": ["http-client", "bonus-api", "get"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:requestBonusNotified", "type": "function", "name": "requestBonusNotified", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [138, 144], "summary": "POST 确认一个已实际展示的 bonus 订单（order_id），响应无数据。", "tags": ["http-client", "bonus-api", "post"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:logoutAccount", "type": "function", "name": "logoutAccount", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [159, 164], "summary": "调用 Platform 既有 logout 端点结束会话，携带存储的账户 token。", "tags": ["http-client", "logout", "post"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:platformRequest", "type": "function", "name": "platformRequest", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [172, 241], "summary": "统一响应读取器：fetch 拒重定向；流式读体并设 65536 字节上限；401+token 头或 code 40003 抛 AccountUnauthorizedError；envelope zod 校验、biz_code≠0 视为协议失败；调用方取消静默，其余失败向 stderr 输出非敏感诊断，finally 释放 reader。", "tags": ["http-client", "response-validation", "streaming", "error-handling"], "complexity": "complex"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts:loginOrigin", "type": "function", "name": "loginOrigin", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/protocol.ts", "lineRange": [248, 258], "summary": "接受浏览器可达的 loopback HTTP origin（显式端口，localhost/127.0.0.1/[::1]）用于本地或 SSH 转发登录；远程域名与基于路径的代理不支持。", "tags": ["validation", "url", "loopback", "ssh"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "file:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "type": "file", "name": "details.ts", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "summary": "Platform Web 资料与钱包查询向账户 UI 的投影：zod 校验 user/summary/bonus 响应（decimal 正则兼容 big.js 文法），profile/balance 两个独立查询失败互不传染，bonus 列表投影为 AccountBonusNotification；永不保留凭据或多余字段。", "tags": ["data-model", "projection", "zod", "account-api"], "complexity": "moderate"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts:profile", "type": "function", "name": "profile", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "lineRange": [31, 36], "summary": "校验并投影 Platform 用户响应为 UI AccountProfile（avatar/name/contact 掩码保留），解析失败抛 protocol。", "tags": ["projection", "zod", "account-profile"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts:accountPayload", "type": "function", "name": "accountPayload", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "lineRange": [46, 55], "summary": "通用 zod 安全解析包装：失败时向 stderr 记录 issue path/code 并抛 PlatformAuthError('protocol')。", "tags": ["utility", "zod", "error-handling"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts:readAccountDetail", "type": "function", "name": "readAccountDetail", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "lineRange": [80, 88], "summary": "按 field 读取 profile 或钱包余额（各自独立端点），AccountUnauthorizedError 原样上抛触发过期处理，其余失败转为 failed 结果——失败绝不变成零余额。", "tags": ["query", "account-api", "error-handling"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts:readUnnotifiedBonuses", "type": "function", "name": "readUnnotifiedBonuses", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "lineRange": [98, 109], "summary": "读取一份凭据下未通知的 bonus 列表并按条件展开可选元数据字段，保持 Platform 顺序，载荷畸形即协议失败。", "tags": ["query", "bonus-api", "projection"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "function:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts:sendBonusNotified", "type": "function", "name": "sendBonusNotified", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/details.ts", "lineRange": [120, 123], "summary": "以读取该 bonus 时所用的凭据确认其已展示；HTTP 与业务失败直接上抛。", "tags": ["mutation", "bonus-api"], "complexity": "simple"},
    {"id": "file:packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/logout.ts", "type": "file", "name": "logout.ts", "filePath": "packages/credentials/deepseek-account-platform/src/logout.ts", "summary": "有界、仅内存追踪的 token 后台吊销：revokeAccount 以指数退避重试 logout 请求（上限 maxRetries、每次请求超时），provider 生命周期结束即中止；远程失败永不恢复本地已移除的 grant。", "tags": ["retry", "logout", "background", "revocation"], "complexity": "simple"},
